### OrderSync demo requests (VS Code REST Client extension)
# Paste the callback URLs from each workflow's Overview page in VS Code.
@orderSync = http://localhost:7071/api/OrderSync/triggers/When_a_HTTP_request_is_received/invoke?api-version=2022-05-01&sp=%2Ftriggers%2FWhen_a_HTTP_request_is_received%2Frun&sv=1.0&sig=wmOMwRV_y_ksvuDF5OPe_IPQ2uSGT6hVD_6gY-hFz3M
@orderSyncNoHandling = http://localhost:7071/api/OrderSyncNoHandling/triggers/When_a_HTTP_request_is_received/invoke?api-version=2022-05-01&sp=%2Ftriggers%2FWhen_a_HTTP_request_is_received%2Frun&sv=1.0&sig=yE-DlaBQLm-N1x7hQzKBwGVJRuIX1T6foYZ0ruSPHF0
# Demo 1 uses @orderSyncNoHandling, Demo 2 uses @orderSync. Expected fault codes are for Demo 2.

### Demo 1: the same SQL failure with no handling
POST {{orderSyncNoHandling}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "SO-9931", "customer": { "id": "4471" }, "sku": "WIDGET-01", "quantity": 3, "depot": "MAN" }

### 0. Happy path -> 200
POST {{orderSync}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-correlation-id: run-demo-ok

{ "orderId": "SO-{{$randomInt 10000 99999}}", "customer": { "id": "4471" }, "sku": "WIDGET-01", "quantity": 3, "depot": "MAN" }

### 1. Your workflow: no customer -> FLOW-EXPR-400 (Flow)
POST {{orderSync}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-correlation-id: run-demo-flow

{ "orderId": "SO-{{$randomInt 10000 99999}}", "sku": "WIDGET-01", "quantity": 3, "depot": "MAN" }

### 2. Blob Storage: no profile for customer 9999 -> BLOB-READ-404 (Data)
POST {{orderSync}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-correlation-id: run-demo-blob

{ "orderId": "SO-{{$randomInt 10000 99999}}", "customer": { "id": "9999" }, "sku": "WIDGET-01", "quantity": 3, "depot": "MAN" }

### 3. SQL: SO-9931 already exists -> SQL-INSERT-409 (Data)
POST {{orderSync}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-correlation-id: run-41217

{ "orderId": "SO-9931", "customer": { "id": "4471" }, "sku": "WIDGET-01", "quantity": 3, "depot": "MAN" }

### 4. HTTP API: unknown SKU -> HTTP-CALL-422 (Data)
POST {{orderSync}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-correlation-id: run-demo-http

{ "orderId": "SO-{{$randomInt 10000 99999}}", "customer": { "id": "4471" }, "sku": "BAD-01", "quantity": 3, "depot": "MAN" }

### 5. Child workflow: unknown depot -> WF-CALL-400 (Data)
POST {{orderSync}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-correlation-id: run-demo-child

{ "orderId": "SO-{{$randomInt 10000 99999}}", "customer": { "id": "4471" }, "sku": "WIDGET-01", "quantity": 3, "depot": "XX" }

